  dialogueLines:
  - I could stay here a while.
  - "We make a good team, don\u2019t we?"
  - Maybe I'll turn on the radio? Where is it...
  - What were we looking for again?
  - "I keep thinking I\u2019ll remember something, but it slips away."
  - "You always find the right way. I can\u2019t keep up."
  - Was this your home? Or mine?
  - Where did the music go?
  - I can help! Let me try.
  - "It\u2019s so quiet here\u2026 but not in a bad way."
  startDialogueText: We should pack the things to the boxes.
  completionDialogueText: Great job, we did it in no-time!
